      "id": "l1",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Indices and global ETFs",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Indices and global ETFs"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-indeksy-i-globalne-etf.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "An **index** is a basket of companies that measures a whole market, e.g. the 500 largest US companies or thousands of companies worldwide."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "An **index ETF** buys that whole basket in one order, at **very low cost**."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "A global ETF is the simplest diversification for decades – you don't pick the winners, **you own them all**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Averaging the purchase price (DCA)",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Averaging the purchase price (DCA)"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-usrednianie-ceny-dca.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**DCA** (Dollar Cost Averaging) means investing **a fixed amount every month**, no matter what the market is doing."
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Prices fall** – 100 € buys you more units",
                "**Prices rise** – you buy fewer"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "You don't guess the right moment – **regularity** does the work for you."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
